Warhammer Armies Revamped is licensed in two parts, because it holds two kinds
of work.

  1. The code - the build and extraction scripts, the site generator and the
     Typst template (build.py, emit.py, check_site.py, extract/, site/ and
     src/template.typ) - is licensed under the MIT License, below.

  2. The books - the text, army lists and points values of Warhammer Armies
     Revamped in src/, the published PDFs, and the cover illustrations in
     assets/ - are licensed under the Creative Commons
     Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
     (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), below.

Both grants cover only what Warhammer Armies Revamped itself contributes. The
books are an unofficial, non-commercial fan edition built on the Warhammer
Armies Project, written and freely distributed by Mathias Eliasson; his work
remains his and is not relicensed here. Warhammer, Warhammer Fantasy Battle and
all associated names, races and places are trademarks of Games Workshop
Limited, are used without permission, and are outside both licenses. This
project is unofficial and unaffiliated, and no challenge to their status is
intended.

